@startuml
title GET /api/v1/course - Get Courses Flow

start

:Client sends GET /api/v1/course request;

note right
Optional Query Parameters:
- page: int
- pageSize: int
- categoryId: Guid
- difficultyLevelId: Guid
- status: bool
- search: string
end note

:Request reaches CourseController;

:Controller validates parameters;

if (Validation failed?) then (Yes)
    :Return 400 Bad Request;
    stop
endif

:Controller forwards request to Mediator;

:Mediator sends GetCourseQuery to Handler;

:Handler calls CourseService;

:CourseService retrieves paginated courses with filters;

:Handler maps Course entities to CourseSummaryDto;

:Controller returns 200 OK with paginated course list;

stop

@enduml
